#: title/pc5_ui.c:7511
msgid "What the game sees when you play with the controller."
msgstr "Apa yang dilihat game saat Anda bermain dengan kontroler."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7512
msgid "Xbox controller: what most PC games expect. Try this first."
msgstr ""
"Kontroler Xbox: yang diharapkan sebagian besar game PC. Coba ini dulu."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7513
msgid ""
"DualSense: a PS5 controller plugged into a PC, with PlayStation buttons in "
"games that support it."
msgstr ""
"DualSense: kontroler PS5 yang dicolokkan ke PC, dengan tombol PlayStation "
"di game yang mendukungnya."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7514
msgid ""
"Keyboard & mouse: for games with no controller support. The buttons press "
"keys and the sticks move the mouse; Button mapping changes which key each "
"one sends."
msgstr ""
"Keyboard & mouse: untuk game tanpa dukungan kontroler. Tombol menekan "
"tombol keyboard dan stik menggerakkan mouse; Pemetaan tombol mengatur "
"tombol keyboard mana yang dikirim tiap tombol."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7517
msgid ""
"What each button, stick and the touchpad sends to the game with Keyboard & "
"mouse."
msgstr ""
"Apa yang dikirim setiap tombol, stik, dan touchpad ke game dengan Keyboard "
"& mouse."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7518
msgid ""
"Touchpad: One button (a click sends one key), Halves and swipes (a key for "
"each half's click and each quick swipe up, down, left or right), or Mouse "
"(a finger moves the pointer, like a laptop's)."
msgstr ""
"Touchpad: Satu tombol (klik mengirim satu tombol keyboard), Separuh dan "
"usapan (satu tombol keyboard untuk klik tiap separuh dan tiap usapan cepat "
"ke atas, bawah, kiri, atau kanan), atau Mouse (jari menggerakkan penunjuk, "
"seperti di laptop)."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7519
msgid "Two-finger click: PC5's on-screen keyboard, or a key of its own."
msgstr "Klik dua jari: keyboard layar PC5, atau tombol keyboard tersendiri."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7520
msgid "Save as my mapping keeps your layout for every game set up after it."
msgstr ""
"Simpan sebagai pemetaan saya memakai tata letak Anda untuk setiap game "
"yang disiapkan sesudahnya."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7523
msgid "Whether the game sees the Create button."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7524
msgid ""
"Sent: the game sees it, as Back (Select) on an Xbox controller or as "
"Create on a DualSense."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7525
msgid ""
"Not sent: the game never sees it, so taking a screenshot with the PS5's "
"Create button doesn't press anything in the game."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7528
msgid "Whether the mouse pointer shows over the game."
msgstr "Apakah penunjuk mouse tampil di atas game."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7529
msgid "Normal: the game decides, as on a PC."
msgstr "Normal: game yang menentukan, seperti di PC."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7530
msgid ""
"Auto-hide: hidden after 5 seconds without moving or clicking, for a game "
"that leaves it on the screen."
msgstr ""
"Sembunyi otomatis: disembunyikan setelah 5 detik tanpa digerakkan atau "
"diklik, untuk game yang membiarkannya di layar."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7533
msgid ""
"How the game's pictures are made on the console. Auto is right for almost "
"every game; the others are for a game that won't start or shows a wrong "
"picture."
msgstr ""
"Cara gambar game dibuat di konsol. Otomatis cocok untuk hampir semua game; "
"yang lain untuk game yang tidak mau jalan atau gambarnya salah."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7535
msgid ""
"Alternative: another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong "
"with Auto."
msgstr ""
"Alternatif: cara lain untuk menggambar game. Coba jika gambarnya salah "
"dengan Otomatis."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7536
msgid ""
"2D only: for a 2D game that flickers or shows only part of its screen."
msgstr ""
"Hanya 2D: untuk game 2D yang berkedip atau hanya menampilkan sebagian "
"layarnya."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7538
msgid ""
"Alternative: slower than Auto. Try it if the game won't start or its "
"picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Alternatif: lebih lambat dari Otomatis. Coba jika game tidak mau jalan "
"atau gambarnya salah."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7540
msgid ""
"Auto: OpenGL is ready for the game in case it asks for it while it runs."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7541
msgid ""
"Windows only: without OpenGL. Try it if the game starts or draws worse "
"with Auto."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7543
msgid ""
"Alternative: another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong "
"with Auto. Some mods need it."
msgstr ""
"Alternatif: cara lain untuk menggambar game. Coba jika gambarnya salah "
"dengan Otomatis. Beberapa mod memerlukannya."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7544
msgid "Compatibility (slow): the slowest, but it starts the most games."
msgstr ""
"Kompatibel (lambat): paling lambat, tapi paling banyak game bisa jalan."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7546
msgid "Choose the row to see each one with what it does."
msgstr "Pilih barisnya untuk melihat tiap pilihan beserta fungsinya."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7549
msgid ""
"Makes extra frames between the game's own, so movement looks smoother. It "
"can add a little delay to the controls."
msgstr ""
"Membuat frame tambahan di antara frame game sendiri, agar gerakan terlihat "
"lebih mulus. Bisa menambah sedikit jeda pada kontrol."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7550
msgid "30 → 60 fps: the game is held at 30 fps and shown at 60."
msgstr "30 → 60 fps: game ditahan di 30 fps dan ditampilkan di 60."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7551
msgid ""
"60 → 120 fps: held at 60 and shown at 120, on a 120 Hz TV with 120 Hz "
"output on in Settings."
msgstr ""
"60 → 120 fps: ditahan di 60 dan ditampilkan di 120, di TV 120 Hz dengan "
"Output 120 Hz aktif di Pengaturan."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7552
msgid ""
"40 → 120 fps: held at 40, two frames made between each two, for a game "
"that can't hold 60."
msgstr ""
"40 → 120 fps: ditahan di 40, dua frame dibuat di antara tiap dua, untuk "
"game yang tidak bisa bertahan di 60."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7555
msgid ""
"The size the game is drawn at. The console always shows 4K, so a smaller "
"picture is scaled up."
msgstr ""
"Ukuran game digambar. Konsol selalu menampilkan 4K, jadi gambar yang lebih "
"kecil diperbesar."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7556
msgid "1080p: the fastest, and right for most games."
msgstr "1080p: paling cepat, dan tepat untuk sebagian besar game."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7557
msgid "1440p: sharper, but slower."
msgstr "1440p: lebih tajam, tapi lebih lambat."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7558
msgid ""
"4K: the sharpest, four times the work of 1080p: only for light games."
msgstr "4K: paling tajam, empat kali kerja 1080p: hanya untuk game ringan."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7561
msgid "The shape of the picture on the TV."
msgstr "Bentuk gambar di TV."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7562
msgid ""
"Keep: the picture's own shape. An older 4:3 game gets black bars at the "
"sides."
msgstr ""
"Pertahankan: bentuk asli gambar. Game lama 4:3 mendapat bilah hitam di "
"sisi."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7563
msgid "Stretch: fills the whole screen, so a 4:3 picture gets wider."
msgstr ""
"Rentangkan: memenuhi seluruh layar, jadi gambar 4:3 jadi lebih lebar."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7566
msgid "How much memory an older 32-bit game may use."
msgstr "Berapa banyak memori yang boleh dipakai game 32-bit lama."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7567
msgid "Auto: as on Windows, 4 GB for a game made for it, otherwise 2 GB."
msgstr ""
"Otomatis: seperti di Windows, 4 GB untuk game yang dibuat untuk itu, "
"selain itu 2 GB."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7568
msgid ""
"4 GB: for a game that runs out of memory, often with big mods. Set it back "
"to Auto if the game misbehaves."
msgstr ""
"4 GB: untuk game yang kehabisan memori, sering dengan mod besar. "
"Kembalikan ke Otomatis jika game bermasalah."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7571
msgid ""
"How much graphics memory the game is told the console has. The PS5's "
"memory is shared by the game and its graphics, so more for graphics leaves "
"less for the game."
msgstr ""
"Berapa banyak memori grafis yang dikatakan konsol kepada game. Memori PS5 "
"dibagi antara game dan grafisnya, jadi lebih banyak untuk grafis berarti "
"lebih sedikit untuk game."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7573
msgid ""
"512 MB or 1 GB: less for textures, more for the game, for one that runs "
"out of memory."
msgstr ""
"512 MB atau 1 GB: lebih sedikit untuk tekstur, lebih banyak untuk game, "
"jika memorinya habis."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7574
msgid ""
"Auto: 2 GB at most, so older games don't get confused by a large number."
msgstr ""
"Otomatis: paling banyak 2 GB, agar game lama tidak bingung dengan angka "
"besar."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7575
msgid ""
"3 GB or Maximum: for a game that says there is too little. Set it back to "
"Auto if it misbehaves."
msgstr ""
"3 GB atau Maksimum: untuk game yang melihat terlalu sedikit. Kembalikan ke "
"Otomatis jika bermasalah."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7577
msgid ""
"2 GB or 3 GB: less for textures, more for the game, for one that runs out "
"of memory."
msgstr ""
"2 GB atau 3 GB: lebih sedikit untuk tekstur, lebih banyak untuk game, jika "
"memorinya habis."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7578
msgid "Auto: 4 GB, room for both."
msgstr "Otomatis: 4 GB, cukup untuk keduanya."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7579
msgid ""
"5 GB or 6 GB: more for textures. Set it back to Auto if the game runs out "
"of memory."
msgstr ""
"5 GB atau 6 GB: lebih banyak untuk tekstur. Kembalikan ke Otomatis jika "
"game kehabisan memori."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7580
msgid ""
"Maximum: all of it, only for a game that won't start because it sees too "
"little."
msgstr ""
"Maksimum: semuanya, hanya untuk game yang tidak mau jalan karena melihat "
"terlalu sedikit."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7584
msgid "How many speakers the game is told the console has."
msgstr "Berapa speaker yang dikatakan kepada game dimiliki konsol."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7585
msgid "Stereo: two, right for a TV or headphones."
msgstr "Stereo: dua, untuk TV atau headphone."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7586
msgid ""
"5.1 or 7.1: the game plays each sound on its own speaker of a surround "
"system, and the PS5 sends it on as it does its own games' sound."
msgstr ""
"5.1 atau 7.1: game memutar tiap suara di speakernya sendiri pada sistem "
"surround, dan PS5 meneruskannya seperti suara game-nya sendiri."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7587
msgid ""
"If the game is silent or plays only from the front, set it back to Stereo."
msgstr ""
"Jika game senyap atau hanya terdengar dari depan, kembalikan ke Stereo."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7590
msgid ""
"Changes how the game's work is shared out on the console's processor."
msgstr "Mengubah cara pekerjaan game dibagi di prosesor konsol."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7591
msgid "Off: the fastest for most games."
msgstr "Nonaktif: paling cepat untuk sebagian besar game."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7592
msgid ""
"On: the game's work takes turns, as on a PC. Try it if the game freezes, "
"stutters or hangs while loading; it can be a little slower."
msgstr ""
"Aktif: pekerjaan game bergiliran, seperti di PC. Coba jika game macet, "
"tersendat, atau tertahan saat memuat; bisa sedikit lebih lambat."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7595
msgid ""
"Many PC games need Steam running to start. The console has no Steam, so "
"PC5 stands in for it."
msgstr ""
"Banyak game PC perlu Steam berjalan agar bisa mulai. Konsol tidak punya "
"Steam, jadi PC5 menggantikannya."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7596
msgid "Auto: the game starts as if Steam were running, offline."
msgstr "Otomatis: game mulai seolah Steam sedang berjalan, secara offline."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7597
msgid ""
"Off: the game's own Steam files are used. It won't find Steam and may not "
"start; only for a game that misbehaves with Auto."
msgstr ""
"Nonaktif: file Steam milik game sendiri yang dipakai. Game tidak akan "
"menemukan Steam dan mungkin tidak mau jalan; hanya untuk game yang "
"bermasalah dengan Otomatis."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7600
msgid ""
"A player who got this game running put their settings in the game "
"compatibility list (Report it works)."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7601
msgid ""
"Choose it to see what they changed, and use the same settings. The game's "
"other settings stay as they are."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7604
msgid ""
"Makes the game's Windows new, as a fresh install has it. Use it when a "
"game that used to work stops starting."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7605
msgid ""
"What stays: the game's files, its saves in its Windows user folders "
"(AppData, Documents, Saved Games) and PC5's settings for it."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7606
msgid ""
"What goes back to its default: the Windows settings the game kept in the "
"registry. Some games keep options or saves there; the old registry is kept "
"in the game's pc5/reset-backup folder."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7668
