msgid "Delete the saves of %s?"
msgstr "Hapus data simpanan %s?"

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:9189
msgid ""
"Its saves and settings, kept when it was uninstalled, are deleted. There "
"is no backup and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Data simpanan dan pengaturannya, yang dipertahankan saat instalannya "
"dihapus, akan dihapus. Tidak ada cadangan dan tidak bisa dibatalkan."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9198
#, c-format
msgid "Uninstall %s?"
msgstr "Hapus instalan %s?"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9201
msgid ""
"Keep saves: the game goes, its saves and settings stay, and installing it "
"again puts them back. Delete all: the game, its saves and settings go, "
"with no backup and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Pertahankan simpanan: game dihapus, data simpanan dan pengaturannya tetap, "
"dan menginstalnya lagi akan mengembalikannya. Hapus semua: game, data "
"simpanan, dan pengaturannya dihapus, tanpa cadangan dan tidak bisa "
"dibatalkan."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9203
msgid "Keep saves"
msgstr "Pertahankan simpanan"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9203
msgid "Delete all"
msgstr "Hapus semua"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9206
msgid ""
"This deletes the game and all its saves and settings. There is no backup "
"and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Ini menghapus game beserta semua data simpanan dan pengaturannya. Tidak "
"ada cadangan dan tidak bisa dibatalkan."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9223
#, c-format
