msgstr "Memperbarui pintasan layar beranda"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9295
msgid "Its picture and background"
msgstr "Gambar dan latar belakangnya"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9297
msgid "A newer one may have fixed it"
msgstr "Versi yang lebih baru mungkin sudah memperbaikinya"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9300
#, c-format
msgid "Update to PC5 %s first?"
msgstr "Perbarui ke PC5 %s dulu?"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9302
#, c-format
msgid "You have %s"
msgstr "Anda punya %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9303
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This may already be fixed in it. Update, try the game again, and report it "
"if it still happens. %s."
msgstr ""
"Masalah ini mungkin sudah diperbaiki di versi itu. Perbarui, coba lagi "
"game-nya, dan laporkan jika masih terjadi. %s."

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
